peration sizes.\n5. Apply the most restrictive conditions early in the query, such as at the initial data selection phase, to reduce the dataset size before executing joins and more complex operations.\n"""'}], 'model': 'llama3:8b', 'max_tokens': 1024, 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0.1}}
